    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Pegasystems Inc. describes itself as the leading AI-powered platform for enterprise transformation. According to its website, the world's most influential organizations trust Pega to reimagine work by automating workflows, personalizing customer experiences, and modernizing legacy systems. The company says it has served the world's largest organizations since 1983.\n\nThe site highlights several AI products. Infinity 26 is described as Pega's latest platform release, designed to help enterprises build, orchestrate, and scale AI with greater predictability, control, and measurable value. Pega Platform is presented as unified, predictable, and safe for mission-critical work. Pega Blueprint is an AI-powered workspace that brings business and IT together, combining best practices and governance. The company also describes AI agents that operate with context, compliance, and human oversight.\n\nPegasystems is a public company headquartered in Waltham, Massachusetts, trading under the ticker PEGA. Its SEC Central Index Key is 0001013857. Legal exposure records list 191 entries in Massachusetts.",
